              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 26,
                "start": 26
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to George T. Conway, III, section\u202f10(b) contains a presumption against extraterritoriality and the Charming\u202fBetsy rule, so it should not apply to transactions of foreign issuers on foreign exchanges."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "George T. Conway, III",
          "citations": [
