              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 26,
                "start": 26
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to George T. Conway, III, the Section\u202f10(b) private right of action is purely implied, not expressly provided."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "George T. Conway, III",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "2bd9dfb091769f040e7b3e13741339415f71e10692f51684716231fd2f30b6de",
